## INTRODUCTION

This appendix shows a host-only source code that can be used as the base of your CUDA $^{\mathrm{TM}}$ matrix multiplication code. We have already inserted timer calls in key places so you can use the measurement to isolate the execution time of the function that actually performs the matrix multiplication. It also has the code that you can use to print out the matrix contents and verify the results.

